<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Ultramar cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Ultramar cut.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jefferies &amp; Co Inc cut Ultramar Diamond Shamrock Corp shares to accumulate from buy and lowered earnings estimates.</p>
<p>-- reduced 1997 estimate to $2.25 a share from $2.45, on a pro forma basis for the pending purchase of Total Petroleum, based on July margins that are below Jefferies' Q3 estimates.</p>
<p>-- cut 1998 estimate to $3.45 from $3.75, on a pro forma basis for the pending purchase of Total Petroleum, based on expected pressure on Southwest refining margins in 1998.</p>
<p>-- revised the 12-month stock price downward to a range $36 to $39 a share from a previous $38 to $41 a share.</p>
<p>-- shares were trading up 7/16 at 34-3/16.</p>
</text>
